<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   42.00		 42.10</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	68.30		 68.40</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 24.30		 24.35</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.369		 0.371</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.17		 11.19</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.42		 11.44</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.06		  1.08</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 3.80 pct	    4.00 pct</p>
</text>
